  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN231.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṉ piriviṉkaṇ vēṟupaṭṭa talaimakaṭkut tōḻi colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said to HER who had undergone changes during the separation from HIM.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN231.1">
        <l><anchor n="1"/>ceṟuvōr cemmal vāṭṭañ cērntōrk</l>
        <l>kuṟumiṭat tulakku mutavi yāṇmaiyu</l>
        <l>millirun tamaivōrk kil<supplied>le</supplied>ṉ ṟeṇṇi </l>
        <l>nallicai valitta nāṇuṭai maṉattar </l>
        <l>koṭuviṟ kāṉavar kaṇaiyiṭat tolaintōr</l>
        <l>paṭukaḷat tuyartta mayirttalaip patukkaik</l>
        <l>kaḷḷiyam paṟantalaik kaḷartoṟuṅ keḻīi</l>
        <l>yuḷḷunarp pa<supplied>ṉi</supplied>kku mū<supplied>kka</supplied>ruṅ kaṭattiṭai</l>
        <l>veñcura miṟantaṉa rāyiṉu neñcuruka</l>
        <l>varuvar vāḻi tōḻi poruvar</l>
        <l>celcamaṅ kaṭanta collar <anchor n="2"/><supplied>na</supplied>llicai</l>
        <l>vicumpivar veṇkuṭaip pacumpūṭ pāṇṭi<supplied>yaṉ</supplied></l>
        <l>pāṭupeṟu ciṟappiṟ kūṭa laṉṉaniṉ</l>
        <l>ṉōṭuvaṇ ṭāṟṟu mucci<supplied>t</supplied></l>
        <l>tōṭā<supplied>r</supplied> meṉṟōṇ marīi yōrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="9c">Although,</l>
        <l>thinking that any manly act of [rendering] help in which one dies</l>
        <l>when it is experienced by those who came close to making fade the enemies’</l>
        <l corresp="1-3">exultation is not for those who are content to sit at home</l>
        <l corresp="7">[and] crowding every [field of] saline soil in the waste land of spurges</l>
        <l>with hair-topped stone heaps raised on battlefields where those who were lost </l>
        <l corresp="5f">fell, when the forest men with cruel bows nocked [their] arrows,</l>
        <l corresp="4">[all] people with a sense of shame, enticed by fame,</l>
        <l corresp="9ab">he traversed the hot desert</l>
        <l corresp="8">in the middle of the wilderness difficult [even] to a zealous [approach] where those who remember shiver,</l>
        <l rend="indent4" corresp="9d">so that [your] hearts melts</l>
        <l corresp="10a-c">he will come, oh friend,</l>
        <l corresp="15">– the one who joined [your] soft shoulder full of petals</l>
        <l corresp="14">from the hair tuft that is sought by running bees</l>
        <l corresp="13">of you who are like Kūṭal of an excellence that attracts song,</l>
        <l corresp="12">[belonging to] the Pāṇṭiya with green[-golden] ornaments, a sky-climbing white parasol</l>
        <l corresp="10d-11">[and] fame among the speakers who overcame fighters in ongoing battle.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>


